a3682e","slug":"ac-6","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"cid":"sha256:fc2cb10fdd8bd5cfef3ce844612fab1a564781c688fdb63240af09284092d1fb","slug":"ac-7","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"cid":"sha256:4d720767e69bf08501c68ecae2c6491ed7b9091d6b1ab8a59516620f0996bd33","slug":"ac-8","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"cid":"sha256:ea0ea3dc0cbea599ba4acc01ad6fb6beb56d8c9d35bfb95323051f11fa0c0b9d","slug":"ac-9","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"cid":"sha256:a126c152662103e9e217dd134cbda6353fe8c44ccdf6f2d1ec0c99eaee184109","slug":"ac-10","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"cid":"sha256:3b683b739499819f6e88f56f6db3fb36fcfc26ccda6fef05ea6e3d8de3d43f95","slug":"ac-11","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}}],"judgements":[{"about":"sha256:76bd1c134b089ad9beb9b4170d0130a2e1244975276c0711588ad3bbcf078106","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because the documented login URL is the entry to the authentication boundary for every user.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:7b5008762076a6532833778077e703637c8de551e6258af441fe70441c6e9a46","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because the username field is a required authentication control exposed to all users.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:407243d135d3502224d4105672657800370b6057175393563a98a81f890d9c1c","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because default password masking protects entered credentials on the primary sign-in surface used by every user.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:b4d1e3be611ff9bd4016d1274f59aea4358982a796125a3dd5a022181b72ee00","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because password reveal/hide behavior touches credential handling on the main authentication path for all users.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:00bc31949adbbe9bdb5a2f477105c7ad1d23c017cd868a6569c4c99e25b0b42f","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because the Sign In control triggers authentication and is used across all login attempts.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:9ea0b75f36fdf251a3d21faaf7af4cd707bcccc7199f882b65e7e4f1bca3682e","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth, user-reach, and change-frequency because the published fixture roster drives persona-based authentication coverage and may change when the product updates its documented personas.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:fc2cb10fdd8bd5cfef3ce844612fab1a564781c688fdb63240af09284092d1fb","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because Remember me is part of the session-entry surface presented to all users, even though persistence semantics were intentionally deferred.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:4d720767e69bf08501c68ecae2c6491ed7b9091d6b1ab8a59516620f0996bd33","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because Forgot password is an authentication-adjacent recovery entry point exposed on the login page.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:ea0ea3dc0cbea599ba4acc01ad6fb6beb56d8c9d35bfb95323051f11fa0c0b9d","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because accessible naming of login form fields is required for all users to complete authentication.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:a126c152662103e9e217dd134cbda6353fe8c44ccdf6f2d1ec0c99eaee184109","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because the password visibility control must remain understandable while handling credential entry.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:3b683b739499819f6e88f56f6db3fb36fcfc26ccda6fef05ea6e3d8de3d43f95","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied auth and user-reach because keyboard operability of the login controls affects whether all users can reach the authentication boundary successfully.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}}],"design_of":{"uc_cid":"sha2